{"code":0,"message":"success","resultList":[{"topicId":"0201208607403321011","sectionId":"0109140870620153026","postId":"0301208607403321082","parentPostId":"0","authorId":"393eaf0f10544b699d3a54316f6f2bc7","status":2,"deleted":0,"ext":"","first":1,"solved":0,"likes":0,"attachments":0,"content":"<div class=\"cke-article\"><p>在HarmonyOS上使用Electron开发，有大量场景需要编译，例如<a href=\"cid:link_0\">Electron调用C/C++</a>、<a href=\"cid:link_1\">Electron调用ArkTS</a>等，如何配置编译环境？</p></div>","createTime":"20260604061003","updateTime":"20260813172746","attachmentInfoList":[],"uploadInfoList":[],"hrefInfoList":[{"title":"Electron调用C/C++","href":"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/forum/topic/0202203101204463716","name":"link_0"},{"title":"Electron调用ArkTS","href":"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/forum/topic/0201194086884838516","name":"link_1"}],"lastEditUid":"393eaf0f10544b699d3a54316f6f2bc7","lastEditTime":"20260604061003","anonymous":0,"replyTotal":0,"channel":1,"floor":0,"adopted":0,"recommended":0,"officialReply":1,"quality":0},{"topicId":"0201208607403321011","sectionId":"0109140870620153026","postId":"0301208607403321083","parentPostId":"0301208607403321082","authorId":"393eaf0f10544b699d3a54316f6f2bc7","status":2,"deleted":0,"ext":"","first":0,"solved":0,"likes":0,"attachments":0,"content":"<div class=\"cke-article\"><p><strong>【背景知识】</strong></p>  <p>当前仅支持Linux_x86环境交叉编译，推荐使用Ubuntu22.04。</p>  <p><strong>【解决方案】</strong></p>  <ol>  <li>  <p>通过<code>git clone &lt;仓库URL&gt; --branch &lt;分支名&gt;</code>拉取<a href=\"cid:link_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">HarmonyOS化Electron源码</a>，分支与Electron版本对应关系如下（前缀和后缀可能更改，请在仓库中复制具体分支名，勿在此复制）：</p>   <div style=\"max-width: 100.0%;\">  <div style=\"max-width: 100.0%;\">  <table>   <thead>    <tr>     <th/>     <th>Electron25</th>     <th>Electron34</th>     <th>Electron37</th>    </tr>   </thead>       <tr>     <td>对应分支</td>     <td>xxx/114.0.5735.248-xxx</td>     <td>xxx/132.0.6834.161-xxx</td>     <td>xxx/138.0.7204.45-xxx</td>    </tr>     </table>  </div>  </div>   <p>克隆过程中需输入Username和Password（如果反复提示输入Username和Password，则是Username或Password错误），通过右上角SSH密钥/HTTPS密码查看并设置(如果Username为空值，需要实名认证)。</p>   <p><span class=\"easyimage easyimage-full\"><img alt=\"cke_3602.png\" data-originheight=\"490\" data-originwidth=\"2134\" height=\"243\" src=\"cid:pic_0\" style=\"width: 1059.0px;height: 243.0px;\" width=\"1059\"/></span></p>   <p><span class=\"easyimage easyimage-full\"><img alt=\"cke_4549.png\" data-originheight=\"912\" data-originwidth=\"2434\" height=\"413\" src=\"cid:pic_1\" style=\"width: 1102.0px;height: 413.0px;\" width=\"1102\"/></span></p>   <p>注意源码中包含LFS大文件，拉取后执行<code style=\"font-size: 16.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;padding: 2.0px 4.0px;text-align: left;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0.0px;\">git lfs pull</code>检查大文件是否完整拉取，若无反应，则拉取完成。</p>   <p><em>因仓库较大，拉取耗时较长，输入Username和Password后拉取可能耗时5~10分钟，非卡死。<br/>  并且建议拉取时指定分支，否则checkout分支多次耗时。</em></p>  </li>  <li>  <p>拉取源码完成得到<code style=\"font-size: 16.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;padding: 2.0px 4.0px;text-align: left;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0.0px;\">chromium-electron-release</code>，进入<code style=\"font-size: 16.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;padding: 2.0px 4.0px;text-align: left;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0.0px;\">chromium-electron-release/src/ohos_sdk</code>目录，执行<code style=\"font-size: 16.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;padding: 2.0px 4.0px;text-align: left;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0.0px;\">.install</code>文件。执行完成后会新增<code style=\"font-size: 16.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;padding: 2.0px 4.0px;text-align: left;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0.0px;\">toolchains</code>、<code style=\"font-size: 16.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;padding: 2.0px 4.0px;text-align: left;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0.0px;\">openharmony</code>、<code style=\"font-size: 16.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;padding: 2.0px 4.0px;text-align: left;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0.0px;\">native</code>等文件夹。</p>   <p><span class=\"easyimage easyimage-full\"><img alt=\"cke_8432.png\" data-originheight=\"782\" data-originwidth=\"1051\" height=\"460\" src=\"cid:pic_2\" style=\"width: 618.0px;height: 460.0px;\" width=\"618\"/></span></p>   <p><em>仅编译<code style=\"font-size: 16.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;padding: 2.0px 4.0px;text-align: left;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0.0px;\">node</code>需要工具链的情况下，按以上操作获取即可，无需编译Electron源码。<code style=\"font-size: 16.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;padding: 2.0px 4.0px;text-align: left;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0.0px;\">libelectron.so</code>可以从<a href=\"cid:link_1\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"background-color: rgb(236,236,236);font-size: 16.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: left;text-decoration: none;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0.0px;\" target=\"_blank\">electron-release构建包</a>中获取，相应地注意修改编译配置<code style=\"font-size: 16.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;padding: 2.0px 4.0px;text-align: left;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0.0px;\">CMakeLists.txt</code>或<code style=\"font-size: 16.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;padding: 2.0px 4.0px;text-align: left;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0.0px;\">binding.gyp</code>中链接的<code style=\"font-size: 16.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;padding: 2.0px 4.0px;text-align: left;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0.0px;\">libelectron.so</code>的路径。</em></p>  </li>  <li>  <p>配置环境变量为HarmonyOS编译工具链。可以写成<code style=\"font-size: 16.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;padding: 2.0px 4.0px;text-align: left;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0.0px;\">set_env.sh</code>文件在每次编译前执行，也可以写在环境变量中。</p>   <pre><code class=\"language-bash\">export CC=&quot;${Electron源码路径}/src/ohos_sdk/openharmony/native/llvm/bin/clang --target=aarch64-linux-ohos&quot;\nexport CXX=&quot;${Electron源码路径}/src/ohos_sdk/openharmony/native/llvm/bin/clang++ --target=aarch64-linux-ohos&quot;\nexport LD=&quot;${Electron源码路径}/src/ohos_sdk/openharmony/native/llvm/bin/lld --target=aarch64-linux-ohos&quot;\nexport STRIP=&quot;${Electron源码路径}/src/ohos_sdk/openharmony/native/llvm/bin/llvm-strip&quot;\nexport RANLIB=&quot;${Electron源码路径}/src/ohos_sdk/openharmony/native/llvm/bin/llvm-ranlib&quot;\nexport OBJDUMP=&quot;${Electron源码路径}/src/ohos_sdk/openharmony/native/llvm/bin/llvm-objdump&quot;\nexport OBJCOPY=&quot;${Electron源码路径}/src/ohos_sdk/openharmony/native/llvm/bin/llvm-objcopy&quot;\nexport NM=&quot;${Electron源码路径}/src/ohos_sdk/openharmony/native/llvm/bin/llvm-nm&quot;\nexport AR=&quot;${Electron源码路径}/src/ohos_sdk/openharmony/native/llvm/bin/llvm-ar&quot;\nexport CFLAGS=&quot;-fPIC -D__MUSL__=1&quot;\nexport CXXFLAGS=&quot;-fPIC -D__MUSL__=1&quot;</code></pre>  </li> </ol>  <p><strong>【常见FAQ】</strong></p>  <p>Q：是否可以直接使用开发者联盟官网的Command Line Tools中的编译工具链？</p>  <p>A：不可以，Electron的编译工具链与HarmonyOS SDK中的编译工具链存在差异。</p>  <p>Q：执行<code>.install</code>报以下错误。</p>  <pre><code>gzip: stdin: not in gzip format\ntar: Child returned status 1\ntar: Error is not recoverable: exiting now\n</code></pre>  <p>A：使用<code>file &lt;文件名&gt;</code>确认文件格式是否为<code>gzip compressed data</code>，如果不是，则LFS文件未拉取完整，执行<code>git lfs pull</code>拉取。</p></div>","createTime":"20260604061003","updateTime":"20260813172746","attachmentInfoList":[],"uploadInfoList":[{"fileName":"pic_0","fileSize":674909,"filePath":"https://alliance-communityfile-drcn.dbankcdn.com/FileServe